{"id": "70447", "title": "温度", "author": "司溟", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 30, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70447/70447s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70447.htm", "intro": "莫依偎我/我习于冷/志于成冰/莫依偎我/\n    别走近我/我正升焰/万木俱焚/别走近我/\n    来拥抱我/我自温馨/自全清凉/来拥抱我/\n    请扶持我/我已衰老/已如病兽/请扶持我/\n    你等待我/我逝彼临/彼一如我/彼一如我/\n    >\n    ——木心《大卫》\n    爱上冷血动物的温度。\n    温禧第一次见到莫傅司，感觉他像是一位苍白而高贵的死神。\n    莫傅司第一次见到温禧，断定她是一只漂亮却寒微的花瓶。\n    后来死神先生和花瓶小姐发现原来。。。\n    可能慢热，过程纠结，还有励志的神奇功效哦~\n    尽量日更，面对如此勤劳勇敢的偶，乃们还不赶快包养么，还包邮哦亲", "base": "files/article/html/70/70447", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "酷热 30～34.9℃", "file": "10971631.html", "available": false}, {"title": "酷热（2）", "file": "10971632.html", "available": false}, {"title": "酷热（3）", "file": "10971633.html", "available": false}, {"title": "暑热 28～29.9℃", "file": "10971634.html", "available": false}, {"title": "暑热（2）", "file": "10971635.html", "available": false}, {"title": "暑热（3）", "file": "10971636.html", "available": false}, {"title": "小寒 －9.9～－5℃", "file": "10971637.html", "available": false}, {"title": "小寒（2）", "file": "10971638.html", "available": false}, {"title": "小寒（3）", "file": "10971639.html", "available": false}, {"title": "大寒－14.9～－10℃", "file": "10971640.html", "available": false}, {"title": "大寒（2）", "file": "10971641.html", "available": false}, {"title": "大寒（3）", "file": "10971642.html", "available": false}, {"title": "深寒 －19.9～－15℃", "file": "10971643.html", "available": false}, {"title": "深寒（2）", "file": "10971644.html", "available": false}, {"title": "深寒（3）", "file": "10971645.html", "available": false}, {"title": "严寒 －29.9～－20℃", "file": "10971646.html", "available": false}, {"title": "严寒（2）", "file": "10971647.html", "available": false}, {"title": "严寒（3）", "file": "10971648.html", "available": false}, {"title": "炎热 25～27.9℃", "file": "10971649.html", "available": true}, {"title": "炎热（2）", "file": "10971650.html", "available": true}, {"title": "最新更新", "file": "10971